      "content": "[https://github.com/ActiveInferenceInstitute/GEO-INFER](https://github.com/ActiveInferenceInstitute/GEO-INFER)\n\n<columns>\n\n\n[https://pro.arcgis.com/en/pro-app/latest/help/mapping/properties/fuller.htm](https://pro.arcgis.com/en/pro-app/latest/help/mapping/properties/fuller.htm)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n|||\n\n\n\n\n\n|||\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n|||\n\n\n\n**Header:** The memo starts with the official seal of the U.S. State Department, flanked by a stylized Cascadian flag (featuring Douglas fir imagery) and a geometric Dymaxion globe. Below it, the title reads: *\"Cascadian Synergetics: Integrating Regional Wisdom and Advanced Mapping Technologies for Strategic Diplomacy.\"*\n\n- [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suMdl6PD](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suMdl6PD) \n\n\n</columns>\n\n",
